% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a calibrated RGB space through the LMN stage collapses to
% CalRGB. With the ABC stage left at its defaults, three DecodeLMN
% exponents and a MatrixLMN are carried as the CalRGB gammas and matrix
% (the same element order in both, three per input component); the
% components set are the components written.
[/CIEBasedABC <<
  /WhitePoint [0.95 1 1.07]
  /DecodeLMN [{1.8 exp} bind {1.8 exp} bind {1.8 exp} bind]
  /MatrixLMN [0.4 0.2 0.02 0.35 0.7 0.1 0.2 0.1 0.95]
>>] setcolorspace
0.2 0.4 0.6 setcolor
100 100 200 100 rectfill
0.9 0.1 0.1 setcolor
100 300 200 100 rectstroke
showpage
